## 5. Mission Planner (Mission tab)
- [ ] P1: Destination picker: body list from FlightGlobals.Bodies, target orbit altitude or LAND, return yes/no.
- [ ] P2: Stage table: per stage dv, TWR, burn time, mass, fuel, Isp vac/asl from StageReader (exact stock numbers).
- [ ] P3: Legs table: needs per leg from LegBudget.
- [ ] P4: Pass/fail bar: total have vs need, green spare / red short, and which stage is spare or short (StageAllocator).
- [ ] P5: Crew comment on margin via IntercomTalk.Fmt ("Plenty of spare, 400 m/s." / "We won't make it home.").
- [ ] P6: Live update in flight: actual dv used vs planned per leg; log big differences.
- [ ] P7: Save/load chosen mission per craft (MiniJson, AtomicFile).

## 6. Burns + KSP maneuver nodes (Burns tab)
- [ ] N1: NodeReader: read user-placed nodes (vessel.patchedConicSolver.maneuverNodes): dv, UT, burn time (M6), which stage.
- [ ] N2: Burn cards: dv, burn time, stage, fuel left after, start time (T- countdown).
- [ ] N3: NodeWriter: create a real node at UT with prograde/normal/radial dv. Log it.
- [ ] N4: Plan nodes: circularize at Ap/Pe.
- [ ] N5: Plan nodes: same-SOI Hohmann transfer to target body (M1+M3+M9).
- [ ] N6 [BIG - Grok/Cursor]: Interplanetary ejection node (M4) + refine on patched conics until encounter.
- [ ] N7 [BIG - Grok/Cursor]: Mid-course correction node to fix periapsis at target.
- [ ] N8: Capture node at target periapsis (M5).
- [ ] N9: Warp to window / node minus burn half + margin (TimeWarp.fetch.WarpTo). Log.

