## 8. Flight functions
New partial NativeRocket.cs on NativeFlightController; writes FlightCtrlState only in Fly path. Tools: rocket_ascent, rocket_node, rocket_point, rocket_stop.
- [ ] F1: Point-at modes: prograde, retro, normal, antinormal, radial in/out, target, node. Own attitude PD, mid-strength torque use. Log mode changes.
- [ ] F2: MFD cockpit buttons for point-at (replace mjatt buttons when MechJeb absent; MfdNav.SmartMode stays for MJ).
- [ ] F3: Auto-staging loop using M13; plain line "Stage 1 empty, staging." + log reason.
- [ ] F4: Fairings via M14; log why now.
- [ ] F5 [BIG - Grok/Cursor]: Ascent guidance: gravity turn from live TWR (M12), throttle down near max q, to target altitude/inclination, coast to Ap, circularize node.
- [ ] F6: Abort monitor (M15): cut throttle, abort group, crew panic chatter (CrewChatter/IntercomTalk), log.
- [ ] F7: Node executor: point at node, start at half burn time early, ease throttle in last ~1 s of dv, stop at <0.1 m/s. Log.
- [ ] F8: Planner live-updates after each burn (P6 hook).

## 9. Landing
Airless first.
- [ ] L1: Deorbit burn for "land below me" (lower Pe under surface near current ground track). Log.
- [ ] L2: Suicide burn timing from local g + available thrust (M11), live recompute each tick.
- [ ] L3: Radar altitude + slope check (raycast or terrain normal); crew warns if slope too steep, nudge sideways.
- [ ] L4: Slow final touchdown (hold ~2 m/s below 20 m, kill horizontal speed, gear down). Reuse VerticalLandingPolicy where it fits.
- [ ] L5 [BIG - Grok/Cursor]: Atmosphere landing: live density/pressure drag estimate (no per-planet tables), chute deploy safe speed, final burn timing.
- [ ] L6 [BIG - Grok/Cursor]: Land at map-click target (MapWindow click -> lat/lon -> deorbit timing + correction).

